# LF in the repo and in every checkout, on every OS. Windows checkouts used to
# get CRLF (core.autocrlf), which made files differ from what the code reads
# and writes (e.g. few-shot example files, the served index.html).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.webm binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
